{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059863/block/singleImage/3246226/wm/01M5J5M3ZKAPREHRPTDFJ9RN4K.jpg?updatedAt=1792685055\"/><figcaption>凱旋門三房套5.5萬元租出。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產九龍站副區域營業董事余倫鋒表示，分行最新促成九龍站凱旋門 1 座中層 D 室租賃成交，單位實用面積約 846 方呎，採三房套房間隔，另設工人套房。單位坐向北方，望清靜內園景，最新以 5.5 萬元租出，呎租約 65 元。 據悉，上址業主 2008 年以約 1,760 萬元購入單位，持貨約 18 年，近年一直作收租用途，現享近 3.8 厘租金回報，回報理想。 資料顯示，凱旋門位於九龍站柯士甸道西 1 號， 2005 年入伙，共有 4 座，提供 1,050 個單位。 即睇九龍站凱旋門租盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:42.184041+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":279,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:12.278873+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:50.373941+00:00","content_hash":"bbd58692b91465a68f29d9051950fddbc7a67cda815fc41c4c206a0129117fd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:42.184041+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}